      "id": "cdxml-preserve-inherited-label-line-height",
      "status": "verified",
      "summary": "Imported atom labels with no object-level LineHeight or LabelLineHeight must remain inherited on export; an explicit value is emitted only after the effective line-height setting is edited.",
      "officialRule": "LabelLineHeight is optional. When absent, ChemDraw inherits the containing object or document value, then the style sheet, and finally treats the label as Variable.",
